  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb61lT/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official | Momcozy W1 vs Air 1 | Find Your Cozy Pump Style | Compare Momcozy Breast Pumps | Find Ideal Pump for Your Needs | Momcozy Wellness 1 | Heated Breast Pump | Breast Pump with Heat | Heated Wearable Breast Pump | Shop Momcozy Wearable Pumps | Pain-Free Breast Pumping | Warm Massage for Better Flow | Effortless Pumping Anywhere | Built-in Heat & Massage Pump | Mimics baby’s natural nursing with heated massage. Increase milk supply comfortably. | Designed for comfort & convenience. Trusted by 4.5M+ moms worldwide | Designed for busy moms. Discreet, wearable, and now with built-in warming technology. | Not sure which pump to choose? Check our guide on Warm Massage vs. App Control features.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb61lT/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 删除 pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/无痛/缓解疼痛等疼痛功效承诺（含 sans douleur/schmerzfrei/sin dolor），只保留 comfort/gentle 与缓解胀满不适 discomfort 的表述 ▸ 删除自动识别节奏/模拟复制宝宝/饱腹反馈/降低奶量焦虑等智能闭环与仿生宣称；仿生表达只允许 inspired by natural nursing（参考自然哺乳节奏的设计思路）",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb61lT/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；H07 疼痛功效承诺（pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/缓解疼痛等；吸奶疼痛因人而异，只可讲 comfort/gentle 舒适与缓解胀满不适 discomfort）；H09 智能闭环/仿生虚假宣称（自动识别节奏、模拟/复制宝宝、饱腹反馈、降低奶量焦虑）；W1当前为用户主动调节+保存程序，非闭环生理识别",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb61lT/命中原因"
  },
  {
